abstract: >-
  Reproducible computer-assisted proof that M_11 = 17, equivalently that the
  antipodal cut code of K_11 has binary Hamming covering radius 19. This
  refutes the 2009 Esmaeili-Zaghian conjecture at m = 11, the first parameter
  beyond their reported verification range. Curtis White directed the research
  and prompt-engineering workflow; GPT-5.6 Pro was the AI mathematical collaborator.
keywords:
  - covering radius
  - cut code
  - signed complete graph
  - Boolean quadratic form
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Esmaeili-Zaghian conjecture
